WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:11.001
Cora squirted ink at the compass.

2
00:00:11.002 --> 00:00:15.668
The shell showed a picture.

3
00:00:15.669 --> 00:00:23.065
"It's the shipwreck again!" Mo said.

4
00:00:23.066 --> 00:00:30.892
The arrow zoomed out of the compass.

5
00:00:30.893 --> 00:00:33.681
It flashed past the reef.

6
00:00:33.682 --> 00:00:38.418
It zipped around Seaweed Forest.

7
00:00:38.419 --> 00:00:42.287
The three friends raced after it.

8
00:00:42.288 --> 00:00:51.819
But Sasha couldn't keep up.

9
00:00:51.820 --> 00:00:54.985
"Go on without me," she said.

10
00:00:54.986 --> 00:01:00.202
"I'm too small to help anyway."

11
00:01:00.203 --> 00:01:03.688
"No way!" Cora said.

12
00:01:03.689 --> 00:01:06.394
She wrapped a tentacle around Sasha.

13
00:01:06.395 --> 00:01:13.057
"You can swim with me!" Cora said.

14
00:01:13.058 --> 00:01:17.803
Finally the arrow reached the shipwreck.

15
00:01:17.804 --> 00:01:22.588
It pointed toward the bottom of the ship.

16
00:01:22.589 --> 00:01:26.460
"Look! There's a small crack," Mo said.

17
00:01:26.461 --> 00:01:29.017
"And a big crab!"

18
00:01:29.018 --> 00:01:33.827
Snap! The crab snapped one of its claws.

19
00:01:33.828 --> 00:01:37.191
"I'll find you, seahorse!" he yelled.

20
00:01:37.192 --> 00:01:40.800
"Then I'll eat you for lunch!"

21
00:01:40.801 --> 00:01:45.913
Cora watched the crab.

22
00:01:45.914 --> 00:01:50.662
He was trying to get into the ship!

23
00:01:50.663 --> 00:01:55.060
Suddenly he spun around. "I'm hungry.

24
00:01:55.061 --> 00:01:59.290
And that seahorse looked tasty."

25
00:01:59.291 --> 00:02:02.778
He saw Sasha and grinned.

26
00:02:02.779 --> 00:02:05.734
"Almost as tasty as that shrimp!"

27
00:02:05.735 --> 00:02:10.240
"Uh-oh!" Sasha clung to Cora.

28
00:02:10.241 --> 00:02:16.483
"We have to do something," Mo said.

29
00:02:16.484 --> 00:02:20.835
"I have a plan!" Cora said.

